From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:26:54 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Enforce KZ data residency at startup; gate OpenAI behind
 AI_EXTERNAL_ENABLED

- utils/dataResidency.ts: refuse to start in production if MONGO_URI or S3 point outside KZ
- never write new files to Cloudinary when residency is enforced
- OpenAI only with explicit AI_EXTERNAL_ENABLED=true
- npm run check:residency for pre-deploy checks

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
